<title>USA: TSR Inc sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>TSR Inc sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSR Inc said Thursday its board of directors approved a two-for-one split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split will affect holders of record as of October 28, and will be payable on or about November 14, the company said.</p>
<p>After the split, the number of outstanding common shares will increase to 2,914,138 shares from 1,457,069.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
